==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
1-2 meatshields is highly recommended here. The goal here is to defeat the Lemurrs without losing too much ground. A unit such as [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] can fulfill this quota.

